OL,3,GNEWSATeacher unions to start action
OL,4,Ashort of strike over workload pressures
OL,5,
OL,6,FEducation Minister Paul Givan said he
OL,7,Fwas disappointed and has urged the
OL,8,Fteaching unions to continue in
OL,9,Fnegotiations and reconsider their
OL,10,Fdecision.
